\caption{
Predicted phase diagram in the ($r/m_>, \varphi/m_>)$ plane for $m_i$ distributed according to Eq.\eqref{eq:supp_compact_density}. Left: $\psi=0.5$, the system is always delocalized, although there are two phases, with and without growth. Right: $\psi=1.5$, for small redistribution, there is an additional marginal partially localized phase
}
\label{fig:phasediagcompact}
